Dear Product Development Team,

Harbor & Crest is a Houston-based importer. Two programs for you. Photo of the Dodgers stein attached.

1) 3STN4213 - Los Angeles Dodgers ceramic stein cup, 24 oz
- Officially licensed (licensor: Gillygaloo LLC for the team)
- Stoneware, 5.4 x 4.05 x 5.7 in, weight 1.65 lb
- Team colours (green). Dishwasher safe, top rack. Gift box.
- USD 2.90 per pc, MOQ 1,500 pcs
- 40 days production + 40 days sea freight. Made in China.

2) XXCG5EZ - Edge Program, "Confetti" curated recycled glass drinkware collection 2
- 7 styles, 216 pcs per pallet, sold as a pallet program
- Recycled soda-lime glass, multicolour confetti look. Made in Mexico
- Program price USD 21.80, MOQ 100 units
- 45 days production + 30 days shipping

Compliance: FDA food-contact report available for both programs.
Samples: available for XXCG5EZ only.

Kind regards,
Rachel Kim
Harbor & Crest Licensing Imports | Houston, TX

